# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile needs. In particular, local
# node_modules (built for the dev machine) and any credential file from a
# local test run must never end up in the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.mcp.json
**/.claude
**/.claude.json
**/.credentials.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
app/test
